    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom of Daanco is in danger! A great evil is preparing to launch a full-scale attack! When Saucey mysteriously finds himself within Daanco, he is forced into helping the King unite the people of Daanco! They must all work together to make a stand against those that threaten the peace. Embark on this adventure to help Saucey and friends save Daanco!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 vs 3 Turn-Based Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete button prompts during your attacks to deal more damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimate attacks with hand-drawn character cut-ins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items for extra buffs, healing, and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run away from enemies if you really want to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different party members with unique abilities and stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of unique enemies and bosses to fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret superbosses to discover</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic, silly, and fun main quest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new friends who join your party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character specific side quests and post game quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Kingdom of Daanco on your adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious characters are causing trouble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's deeper lore to uncover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasure boxes to find around Daanco</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game +</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames, like fishing! And... uhh... Grambling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... We still don't know what grambling is... But you can play it!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Kingdom of Daanco is in danger! A great evil is preparing to launch a full-scale attack! When Saucey mysteriously finds himself within Daanco, he is forced into helping the King unite the people of Daanco! They must all work together to make a stand against those that threaten the peace. Embark on this adventure to help Saucey and friends save Daanco!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Battle Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 vs 3 Turn-Based Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete button prompts during your attacks to deal more damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimate attacks with hand-drawn character cut-ins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items for extra buffs, healing, and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run away from enemies if you really want to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use different party members with unique abilities and stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of unique enemies and bosses to fight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret superbosses to discover</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epic, silly, and fun main quest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet new friends who join your party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character specific side quests and post game quests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Kingdom of Daanco on your adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mysterious characters are causing trouble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's deeper lore to uncover!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden treasure boxes to find around Daanco</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game +</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames, like fishing! And... uhh... Grambling!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >... We still don't know what grambling is... But you can play it!</p></li></ul>",
